  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted and numbered \r\nDesign and Access Statement and Flood Risk Assessment, 04A, 05A, 06A, 07A, 07 and 07 received 29/07/2011 and 01, 02, 03, 04 received 30/08/2011 therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is occupied.\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - No development shall take place until samples of the material to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the building hereby permitted and the boundary treatment, have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details.",
    "Condition : 4 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995 (or any order revoking, re-enacting or modifying that Order), no enlargement of the premises shall be carried out, no additional structures/buildings (other than those shown on the approved plans) shall be erected within the curtilage of the site, and neither shall any additional windows (other than those expressly authorized by this permission) be created within the fabric of the building.",
    "Condition : 5 - The largest roof light of the new flat to the rear of  the existing shop at No. 38 Chiswick Lane shall be obscure glazed, hinged to open inwards and shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than with obscured glazing."
  ],
